# Feature page layout

Related: [front-end-structure.mdc](front-end-structure.mdc), [ui-kit-project.mdc](ui-kit-project.mdc), [details-page-cards.mdc](details-page-cards.mdc), [details-page-wizard-edit.mdc](details-page-wizard-edit.mdc).

Use **`FeaturePage`** and **`PageHeader`** from `@webonone/ui-kit` for route-level pages rendered inside a product shell main content area (e.g. WebOnOne `AppShell` `<Outlet />`).

## Required pattern

- Wrap page body in **`FeaturePage`** — do not hand-roll inline `<h1>` title blocks.
- **Width:** full width of the shell main content (`w-full`) — do not add `max-w-*` on feature page wrappers.
- **Title block:** `title` + optional `description` props, or a custom `header={<PageHeader … />}`.
- **Header actions:** pass primary page actions via `actions` (e.g. “Create theme”).
- **Spacing:** rely on `FeaturePage` **`gap-6`** between header and body — do not add extra top margin on the first child.
- **Horizontal padding:** do not add `px-*` on `FeaturePage` — `AppShell` / `PageShell` own shell padding (`px-2 sm:px-6` on mobile/desktop). Page content should align with the app header automatically.

## Typography

| Element | Classes |
|---------|---------|
| Title | `text-2xl font-semibold` (via `PageHeader`) |
| Description | `text-sm text-muted-foreground` |

## Exceptions (do not use FeaturePage)

- Auth / callback routes (`AuthLayout`, login redirect pages)
- Iframe / embed chrome (`EmbedLayout`, Media picker/upload/viewer embeds)
- Auth forms (`AuthLayout` card — intentional narrow login/register UI)
- Showcase demo pages that intentionally preview other layouts

## List collection pages (required)

Paginated collection pages inside `FeaturePage` must follow the UI Kit **list page** composition:

```text
FeaturePage (title, description, actions: SearchInput + ListFilterTrigger + CTA)
  ListFilterPanel (panel filters only — not text search)
  Alert (optional errors)
  ListPageBody
    div.flex-1 → ItemList | ItemListEmpty (row actions in ItemListMenu)
    Pagination className="mt-auto" pageSizeOptions={[12, 24, 48]}
```

| Rule | Detail |
|------|--------|
| Search | **`SearchInput`** in `FeaturePage` `actions` — never plain `Input`; never in page body on list pages ([ui-kit-consumption.mdc](ui-kit-consumption.mdc)) |
| Filters | `ListFilterTrigger` + `ListFilterPanel` for status/date/MIME filters |
| Primary CTA | `Button type="button" size="sm"` with a leading `Plus` icon (`h-4 w-4`, `aria-hidden`) **and** a visible label (e.g. `Add tag`) — icon **+ text**, not icon-only; last in `actions`, gated on permission |
| Loading | `usePlatformLoading('Loading …')` — AppLayout owns overlay; hide list body while loading |
| Row actions | `ItemListMenu` — no inline row `Button` groups; destructive item last, after `DropdownMenuSeparator`, styled `text-destructive focus:text-destructive` |
| Embed peers | Same markup + `min-h-full` flex chain — [platform-shell-navigation.mdc](platform-shell-navigation.mdc) |

Header CTA reference:

```tsx
<Button type="button" size="sm" onClick={() => setDialog({})}>
  <Plus className="h-4 w-4" aria-hidden />
  Add tag
</Button>
```

Canonical demo: `ui-kit/showcase/src/pages/pages/PageDemos.tsx` (`ListPageDemo`). Production references: `data/.../CatalogListPage.tsx`, `email/.../HistoryPage.tsx`, `media/.../LibraryPage.tsx`.

Skill: [.cursor/skills/item-list/SKILL.md](../skills/item-list/SKILL.md) · Rules: [item-list-pagination.mdc](item-list-pagination.mdc), [list-filter-panel.mdc](list-filter-panel.mdc), [loading-empty-states.mdc](loading-empty-states.mdc).

## Details / profile pages (required)

Multi-section details pages must use the **card grid** (`gap-6`, left span-2 / right span-1) — not bare stacked sections. Pick the edit pattern by create UX:

| Create UX | Details chrome | Docs |
|-----------|----------------|------|
| Inline / single form | Back + **one page-level Edit** → Cancel/Save; cards become fields | [details-page-cards.mdc](details-page-cards.mdc) · [skill](../skills/details-page-cards/SKILL.md) |
| Multi-step wizard | Back only; **per-card Edit** → shared create/edit wizard | [details-page-wizard-edit.mdc](details-page-wizard-edit.mdc) · [skill](../skills/details-page-wizard-edit/SKILL.md) |

```text
FeaturePage actions: Back (+ Edit | Cancel + Save when inline)
  grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3 (Form → also space-y-0 items-start)
    left flex-col gap-6 lg:col-span-2  → wide Cards
    right flex-col gap-6 lg:col-span-1 → narrow Cards
```

Inline demos: `DetailsPageDemo`. Wizard-backed: Data `ServiceDetailsPage`, WebOnOne `CompanyProfilePage`, Identity `ProfilePage`.

